  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lcoal self-gov. study</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Studie lokal f&#xf6;rvaltning</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Studie och projektplanering r&#xf6;rande lokal f&#xf6;rvaltning i Makedonien. Sida finansierar studien som har till syfte att kartl&#xe4;gga behoven inom lokal f&#xf6;rvaltning p&#xe5; kommunniv&#xe5; samt att utveckla projektf&#xf6;rslag p&#xe5; omr&#xe5;det. Svensk genomf&#xf6;rande part &#xe4;r Arne Svensson, Professional Management. Sida-st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r 1999-2000 omfattar 181 000 kronor.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Study and project planning concerning local government in Macedonia. Sida will finance the study which aims to map the necessities within local governments at a municipality level, and to develop project- proposals on this subject. Swedish counterpart is Arne Svensson, Professional Management. The Sida-support amounts to 181 000 SEK.</narrative>
  </description>
